<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The Chocolatey package. release.ps1 copies this folder to Releases\chocolatey, fills in __VERSION__ here and the
     download addresses and checksums in tools\chocolateyinstall.ps1, and packs it. Edit the text here, not there. -->
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>spacesharp</id>
    <version>__VERSION__</version>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/SpaceSharpApp/SpaceSharp/tree/main/installer/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <owners>ClearanceClarence</owners>
    <title>SpaceSharp</title>
    <authors>ClearanceClarence</authors>
    <projectUrl>https://spacesharp.app/</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/SpaceSharpApp/SpaceSharp@main/docs/app-icon-256.png</iconUrl>
    <copyright>© 2026 ClearanceClarence</copyright>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/SpaceSharpApp/SpaceSharp/blob/main/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/SpaceSharpApp/SpaceSharp</projectSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://docs.spacesharp.app/</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/SpaceSharpApp/SpaceSharp/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>spacesharp disk-space disk-usage treemap storage cleanup duplicates foss</tags>
    <summary>See where your disk space went: a treemap of every file and folder, sized by the space it uses.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[SpaceSharp maps every file and folder on a drive as a box sized by the space it uses, so the biggest ones stand out. It is free, open source (MIT) and sends nothing anywhere.

## Features

- **A treemap of the whole drive**, in the style of SpaceMonger, with folders nested inside folders and names on the boxes.
- **Whole drives in seconds**: with administrator rights it reads the NTFS file table instead of walking every folder.
- **Insights and Statistics**: what takes the space by kind, age and size, the largest files and folders, and what you can do about it.
- **Changes**: scan again and compare with a saved scan to see what grew and what shrank.
- **Duplicates and empty folders**, with the files going to the Recycle Bin.
- **Filters, export** to CSV, JSON, HTML and more, custom color palettes, and 18 languages.

## Package notes

- This package installs the signed MSI from the project's GitHub release.
- SpaceSharp updates itself from inside the app. `choco upgrade spacesharp` works too once the new version of the package is approved.
- Windows 10 and 11, x64 and x86.]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SpaceSharpApp/SpaceSharp/releases/tag/__VERSION__</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
